    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Gary O'Driscoll & Co. Ltd are delighted to bring to the market this substantial four-bedroom detached residence, ideally situated at Glenlea, Ballyheigue. Constructed in the 1990s, the property is set on a generous 0.84-acre site and offers spacious accommodation, excellent potential and a peaceful rural setting, while being conveniently located just 2.7 km from Ballyheigue Village.\n\nThe property is constructed using cavity wall construction, with the cavities having been pumped and the attic insulation upgraded. It benefits from triple-glazed windows throughout and an oil-fired central heating system with zoned heating, providing efficient and comfortable living accommodation.\n\nThe ground floor accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hallway, spacious sitting room, large kitchen/dining room, inner hallway, family bathroom and four well-proportioned bedrooms, with the master bedroom benefiting from its own en-suite. The property also has stairwell access to a substantial attic storage area providing excellent additional storage space.\n\nExternally, the property is positioned on a large site and benefits from a substantial corrugated iron shed, providing extensive storage or workshop space. The generous grounds offer considerable potential for those seeking a family home with space both internally and externally.\n\nGlenlea offers a superb combination of space, privacy and convenience, with Ballyheigue Village and its amenities located just a short drive away. The nearby coastline, beaches and surrounding countryside further enhance the appeal of this property.\n\nViewing is highly recommended to appreciate the generous accommodation, large site and excellent potential this property has to offer.\n\nAccommodation briefly consists of: \n\nEntrance hallway: \n1.82 x 3.45 \n\nSitting room: \n2.37 x 4.50 \n\nKitchen / dining room: \n4.58 x 6.68 \n\nHallway: \n8.76 x 1.03 \n\nBathroom: \n1.80 x 3.41 \n\nMaster bedroom: \n3.31 x 3.94 \n\nEn-suite:\n1.68 x 1.34 \n\nBedroom 2: \n3.33 x 3.71 \n\nBedroom 3: \n3.44 x 3.14 \n\nBedroom 4: \n3.43 x 2.93 \n\nAttic storage: \n9.16 x 2.80"
      },
